  Hello World
</a>
```
5. In your Nginx configuration, update the `root` directive in the location block that handles the post requests:
```nginx
location ~ ^/post/([a-zA-Z0-9_-]+)$ {
  root /usr/share/nginx/html/posts;
  try_files $uri.html =404;
}
```
This tells Nginx to look for post files in the `posts` directory.

6. Finally, restart Nginx to apply the new configuration:
```
sudo service nginx restart
```
